# What the study of the earlier in-house NUMS.Go study found (study/r2/gap-nums-study-2023.md).

n: 3.8
name: nums-study-2026
kind: hub
is: The folder nums-go-2023 of the parent repository is an assistant-written study of 2026-05-08, 1,804 lines, with a 687-line Python miniature. The miniature interns recipe trees and evaluates nothing; its 7 tests (15 assertions) pass and its cross-language test compares a constant with itself. The mapping blueprint = ice, recipe = water, cell = gas first appears there, is absent from NUMS.Go and was corrected by the body on 2026-06-08. A run of NUMS.Go contradicts the folder on struct identity and constructor sharing. No C++ NUMS is on disk.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r2/gap-nums-study-2023

