n: 3.8.8.1
name: cell-as-four-part-slot
kind: finding
is: Carry forward the cell as a four-part declared slot: an access recipe, a base blueprint, a name and a constructor recipe, with the constructor stored as a recipe and referred to by id. NUMS.Go's own NamedCell_t record has that form, and mini-nums reproduces the form and checks it in its test 3.
