is: Drop the statements that NUMS.Go is 'a working model' and supports 14 languages. Thirteen languages are enumerated and only Go has handlers; the folder nums-go-2023 records no run of NUMS.Go, and the first round found that NUMS.Go does not build as checked in and panics on its three shipped samples.
