n: 3.8.9.3
name: content-addressed-for-arrival-order
kind: finding
is: Stop calling arrival-order interning content-addressed. In NUMS.Go and in mini-nums an id is the Nth distinct shape seen at a level in one module and one run, so the same shape gets another id when statements arrive in another order. Keep the word for ids computed from content.
status: inferred
conf: high
